{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 44, :comments ["<b>Unto the children of Israel.</b> And not all the children of Israel, for he cannot speak with all of them. And likewise it is written, \"Speak unto the children of Israel,\" and there is no objection from the verse \"unto all the congregation of the children of Israel,\" for all Israel is not called a congregation."], :book :leviticus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 23, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:12:03.584252205Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}